# 模拟器专用：验证 RETURN 回退、链尾策略、自定义链不匹配后继续
*filter
:INPUT DROP [0:0]
:FORWARD ACCEPT [0:0]
:OUTPUT ACCEPT [0:0]
:GATE - [0:0]
# 0: 所有 tcp 先跳 GATE
-A INPUT -p tcp -j GATE
# 1: GATE 若 RETURN，tcp/22 放行
-A INPUT -p tcp --dport 22 -j ACCEPT
# 2: 其余落默认 DROP
-A GATE -s 10.0.0.0/8 -j DROP
# GATE 链尾隐式 RETURN
COMMIT
